 from a scrapyard in Vancouver to the Orthodox Jewish community of Bnei Brak and back to a decaying farm in rural Manitoba. Each discovery adds to the visual and narrative collage, building to a surprising and thought-provoking conclusion that invites us to explore our own personal stories.   ", "short_description": "Blood Relations is a whimsical VR documentary about an adopted child and a quest to solve an ancestral mystery."}, {"images": {"nodes": [{"file_name": "BloodRelations_KeyArt-Portrait1008x1440FRA_v01.png", "id": "3185431641772787", "image_type": "APP_IMG_COVER_PORTRAIT", "uri": "https://scontent-ord5-2.oculuscdn.com/v/t64.5771-25/38974676_3185431645106120_7305487962040821417_n.png?_nc_cat=103&ccb=1-7&_nc_sid=6e7a0a&_nc_ohc=69yHlVmDdkkQ7kNvwEZneGB&_nc_oc=AdrBot-rc8czLF0EBiwTcp24JEc6PmY9kXsKZ9xoL37F2jalbCq7aVmLJofuXq6UNZ0&_nc_zt=3&_nc_ht=scontent-ord5-2.oculuscdn.com&_nc_ss=7f20f&oh=00_AQLbdv3AU6s-MSwdqwmgpiVUEV3ih_RaEZRptkvvctxhPQ&oe=6ABBD6C1"}, {"file_name": "BloodRelations_TrCoverImage2560x1440FRA_v01.png", "id": "2112431928963685", "image_type": "APP_IMG_COVER_LANDSCAPE", "uri": "https://scontent-ord5-2.oculuscdn.com/v/t64.5771-25/38974453_2112431932297018_1168886450594301820_n.png?_nc_cat=100&ccb=1-7&_nc_sid=6e7a0a&_nc_ohc=JrB77YIwoc8Q7kNvwHmI2N6&_nc_oc=Adp_8h-N25JAI17qC9wp7D96RwfC7m33-158uSig-uA4-pjBcmN6zSy2DWbUiKr0dss&_nc_zt=3&_nc_ht=scontent-ord5-2.oculuscdn.com&_nc_ss=7f20f&oh=00_AQJjDIM5FaBCjzthohj6a9arXCzbwZZJNHeO9Cx8tUmAaA&oe=6ABBE426"}, {"file_name": "BloodRelations_KeyArt-Square1440x1440FRA_v01.png", "id": "1965493300326997", "image_type": "APP_IMG_COVER_SQUARE", "uri": "https://scontent-ord5-1.oculuscdn.com/v/t64.5771-25/75262745_1965493303660330_6562698748019357103_n.png?_nc_cat=109&ccb=1-7&_nc_sid=6e7a0a&_nc_ohc=iGDptrJhPfQQ7kNvwHAjLkf&_nc_oc=Adq27ME4RHhOMyZPIVICBROD-t-ve5qB506M6mxl_A6Jkq8aCN1ohzAmtJcvS9sU12A&_nc_zt=3&_nc_ht=scontent-ord5-1.oculuscdn.com&_nc_ss=7f20f&oh=00_AQK__9DEt5qaFkuUfuvfGrnU3cNJs1_5WuMSoN9EguahWw&oe=6ABBB5DC"}, {"fil